      "claim": "Fewer than one hundred people died as a direct result of the Carnation Revolution.",
      "evidence": "Official Portuguese sources and scholarly accounts cite casualty figures ranging from 30 to 50 deaths, with some estimates putting the total under 100.",
      "weight": 0.20,
      "depends_on": [1]
