      "id": 7,
      "claim": "Compared with the death tolls in steps 4‑6, the Carnation Revolution’s death count (< 100) is orders of magnitude lower.",
      "evidence": "Quantitative comparison of the figures shows the Carnation Revolution’s casualties are less than 0.1 % of the lowest comparable European revolutionary death toll.",
